<title>UK: NWE oil, gas rigs up five to 67 last week.</title>
<headline>NWE oil, gas rigs up five to 67 last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs in operation in offshore northwest European waters rose to 67 in the week to February 14 from 62 in the previous week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>Rigs in UK waters rose three to 34 and in Norway went up two to 19.</p>
<p>Dutch drilling was steady at 11 rigs. The Danish tally was stable at three active rigs.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
